":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"MRNA 2021 Q2","e":"mrna","d":"2021-08-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"David Meline","x":"Additionally, we are investing heavily in digital, automation, and AI, as well as scaling up our global commercial operations which will allow us to maximize the impact of our mRNA platform.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"MRNA 2021 Q4","e":"mrna","d":"2022-02-24","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"David Meline","x":"We’re investing in Moderna Science Center in Cambridge and launching an AI Academy.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"MRNA 2022 Q1","e":"mrna","d":"2022-05-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Michael Yee","x":"Can you just rightsize your expectations because it’s five patients but at the lowest dose.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"MRNA 2022 Q4","e":"mrna","d":"2023-02-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Stephane Bancel","x":"We announced an investment in CytomX and the acquisition of OriCiro in Japan to continue to streamline our manufacturing processes.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"MRNA 2023 Q1","e":"mrna","d":"2023-05-04","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Arpa Garay","x":"Consumer promotion will be focused primarily in the fall of this year, driving patients to seek Moderna's COVID vaccine through significant DTC efforts.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"MRNA 2023 Q1","e":"mrna","d":"2023-05-04","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Stephane Bancel","x":"SG&A costs were approximately $200 million in the quarter, which continued investment in digital and also AI infrastructure and approximately $100 million in capital investments.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"MRNA 2023 Q2","e":"mrna","d":"2023-08-03","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Arpa Garay","x":"Branded promotion campaigns will focus on driving brand preference from Moderna's vaccine running direct-to-consumer campaigns across major media channels and conducting promotions with healthcare providers.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"MRNA 2023 Q3","e":"mrna","d":"2023-11-02","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Arpa Garay","x":"Earlier this week, we also launched our branded direct-to-consumer campaign, both on TV as well as across digital channels.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"MRNA 2023 Q3","e":"mrna","d":"2023-11-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jamey Mock","x":"As part of the $1.6 billion in total restructuring charges I just mentioned, only the CMO-related costs and cancellation fees are cash restructuring costs.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"MRNA 2023 Q4","e":"mrna","d":"2024-02-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Stephen Hoge","x":"And importantly as you know, we are adopting AI across the business, which we expect to save time, increase productivity, and drive scalability in addition to cost saving.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"MRNA 2024 Q2","e":"mrna","d":"2024-08-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jamey Mock","x":"I’m very pleased with the cost savings results in the first half of the year and want to thank our Moderna teams.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"MRNA 2024 Q3","e":"mrna","d":"2024-11-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jamey Mock","x":"The reduction is due to cost savings from productivity improvements as well as clinical study timing.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"MRNA 2024 Q3","e":"mrna","d":"2024-11-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Stephen Hoge","x":"As demonstrated in the quarter, we are making progress on our cost saving initiatives already.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"MRNA 2024 Q4","e":"mrna","d":"2025-02-14","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Stephane Bancel","x":"The team has worked hard to generate cost savings of $2.6 billion or 27% down from 2023.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"MRNA 2024 Q4","e":"mrna","d":"2025-02-14","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jamey Mock","x":"Additionally, these savings were supported by better leveraging digital technology and artificial intelligence to streamline operations.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"MRNA 2025 Q1","e":"mrna","d":"2025-05-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jamey Mock","x":"These reductions reflect our continued focus on streamlining operations and managing costs across the organization.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"MRNA 2025 Q1","e":"mrna","d":"2025-05-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jamey Mock","x":"We also reduced SG&A by 24% from 2023 to 2024, through a variety of cost-out initiatives throughout the company, and R&D declined 6% year-over-year to $4.5 billion in 2024.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"MRNA 2025 Q2","e":"mrna","d":"2025-08-01","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"James Mock","x":"Newly introduced tariffs are not expected to have a material impact on our cost of sales.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/12/11/moderna-mrna-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MRNA 2025 Q2","e":"mrna","d":"2025-08-01","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"James Mock","x":"We continue to monitor changes to global tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/12/11/moderna-mrna-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MRNA 2025 Q2","e":"mrna","d":"2025-08-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"James Mock","x":"The decrease reflects broad-based cost reductions across external services, personnel and commercial activities as we continue to streamline operations and manage expenses with discipline.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/12/11/moderna-mrna-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MRNA 2025 Q2","e":"mrna","d":"2025-08-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"James Mock","x":"Similar to last year, we expect higher SG&A expenses in the second half of the year, primarily due to commercial-related activity but also due to severance charges associated with the workforce reduction we announced yesterday.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/12/11/moderna-mrna-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MRNA 2025 Q3","e":"mrna","d":"2025-11-06","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"James Mock","x":"Newly introduced tariffs are not expected to have a material impact on our business, but we continue to monitor changes to global tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/12/11/moderna-mrna-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MRNA 2025 Q3","e":"mrna","d":"2025-11-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"James Mock","x":"These savings reflect the cost discipline we've built into the organization and our continued focus on streamlining how we operate.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/12/11/moderna-mrna-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MRNA 2025 Q3","e":"mrna","d":"2025-11-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"James Mock","x":"With that, let me take a minute to share the progress we've made on our cost reduction goals.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/12/11/moderna-mrna-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MRNA 2025 Q4","e":"mrna","d":"2026-02-13","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"James Mock","x":"We remain focused on driving efficiency and cost savings across the organization, which we will use to fund new commercial investments to support both geographic expansion and future product launches.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/13/moderna-mrna-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MRNA 2025 Q4","e":"mrna","d":"2026-02-13","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"James Mock","x":"We improved our commercial execution, exceeded our cost reduction plan by over $1,000,000,000 compared to our original 2025 guidance, and ended the year with over $2,000,000,000 more cash, all while still advancing our pipeline.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/13/moderna-mrna-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MRNA 2026 Q1","e":"mrna","d":"2026-05-01","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Stephen Hoge","x":"We'll continue to invest in AI with a number of cross enterprise projects to reinvent work with AI.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/01/moderna-mrna-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"MRNA 2026 Q1","e":"mrna","d":"2026-05-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"unknown","s":"Unidentified Speaker","x":"Our cost reduction efforts continued in the first quarter, building on actions taken in 2025 and resulting in a 26% year-over-year reduction in adjusted cash cost in the first quarter, excluding the litigation settlement.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/01/moderna-mrna-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[41,1,11423,0,0,0,9565,1480],[42,1,12787,0,0,0,9312,3111],[43,1,12176,0,0,0,8863,2781],[44,1,13786,0,0,0,8614,4837],[45,1,14451,0,0,0,10210,3800],[46,1,12096,0,0,0,9926,1927],[47,1,14839,0,0,0,9314,5205],[48,1,12492,0,0,0,9972,2236],[49,1,10975,0,0,0,9616,1082],[50,1,9012,0,0,0,7848,827],[51,1,10071,0,0,0,5642,3996],[52,1,11153,0,0,0,9770,1038],[53,1,11432,0,0,0,10098,898],[54,1,7928,0,0,0,6076,1400],[55,1,9842,0,0,0,7937,1572],[56,1,8677,0,0,0,6738,1618],[57,1,2513,0,0,0,1162,935],[5